OL,3,AActor Simon Pegg reveals ADHD
OL,4,Adiagnosis: 'It's just who I am'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShaun of the Dead and Mission:
OL,7,FImpossible films star Simon Pegg has
OL,8,Frevealed he has been diagnosed with
OL,9,FADHD, which he said "confirmed a lot of
OL,10,Fstuff that I'd been wrestling with".
OL,12,FPegg, 56, who also co-created and
OL,13,Fstarred in films Hot Fuzz, The World's
OL,14,FEnd, and TV series Spaced, said "there
OL,15,Fwas a lot of build-up and suspicion,
OL,16,Fand it just took a while actually to
OL,17,Fget there."
OL,19,FSpeaking on the podcast I'm ADHD! No
OL,20,FYou're Not on Thursday, he said he
OL,21,Fpursued a diagnosis as he "just wanted
OL,22,Fto know".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
